{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>By their families.</b> To know the count of every single tribe." "<b>By the house of their fathers.</b> He whose father is from one tribe and his mother from another tribe is counted with his father's tribe. (cf. Bava Batra 109.)" "<b>By their heads.</b> By means of shekels — a bekha per head."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:06.860055030Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}